-- (one at a time, switched every 15 s), Bo Tam Chu 45 below 60% life, curses 47/49 on the target again 1 s before they end (5-14 s by level).
-- Stored in task 2614 (0 = off; else 2^30 + sum 2^(id - 43)), sent with SyncTaskValue.

